<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<topic id="100acdd4-daa3-4e8d-b09d-ad27d242a4af" revisionNumber="1">
  <developerConceptualDocument
    xmlns="http://ddue.schemas.microsoft.com/authoring/2003/5"
    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink">

    <introduction>
      <para>The <legacyBold>scheduleref</legacyBold> element is usefull in cases where several schedules are configured
                and a task should only be executed when one of the schedules fire.
               </para>
               <para>The sample configuration below illustrates this by having one task executed every five seconds while the other task 
               executes every one hour.</para>
    </introduction>

    

<section>
	<content>
    	<code language="xml">
&lt;scheduler&gt;
    &lt;tasks&gt;
        &lt;task type=&quot;KeepAliveTask, MyLibrary&quot;&gt;
            &lt;scheduleref name=&quot;fivesec&quot; /&gt;
        &lt;/task&gt;
        &lt;CodeTask class=&quot;Importer, MyLibrary&quot; method=&quot;ImportOrders&quot;&gt;
            &lt;scheduleref name=&quot;onehour&quot; /&gt;
        &lt;/CodeTask&gt;
    &lt;/tasks&gt;
    &lt;IntervalSchedule name=&quot;fivesec&quot;&gt;
        &lt;start&gt;2006-01-01 00:00:00&lt;/start&gt;
        &lt;interval&gt;00:00:05&lt;/interval&gt;
    &lt;/IntervalSchedule&gt;
    &lt;IntervalSchedule name=&quot;onehour&quot;&gt;
        &lt;start&gt;2006-01-01 00:00:00&lt;/start&gt;
        &lt;interval&gt;01:00:00&lt;/interval&gt;
    &lt;/IntervalSchedule&gt;
&lt;/scheduler&gt;            
        </code>
  </content>
</section>



<section>
	<title>Attributes and Elements</title>
	<content>
	
	<table>
		<title>Attributes</title>
		<tableHeader>	
			<row>
				<entry>Attribute</entry>
				<entry>Description</entry>
			</row>
		</tableHeader>
			<row>
				<entry>
					<legacyBold>name</legacyBold>
				</entry>
				<entry>
					Name of a schedule to associate the task with. This value must match a configured schedule.
				</entry>
			</row>
	</table>
	
	<table>
		<title>Child Elements</title>
			<para>
                    None.
                </para>
	</table>
	
	<table>
		<title>Parent Elements</title>
		<tableHeader>	
			<row>
				<entry>Element</entry>
				<entry>Description</entry>
			</row>
		</tableHeader>
			<row>
				<entry><legacyBold><link xlink:href="d790b6d8-8d98-4af9-9de0-70d22e267cba">task</link> </legacyBold></entry>
				<entry>
					A custom or third-party task.
				</entry>
			</row>
			<row>
				<entry><legacyBold><link xlink:href="9473b45f-5001-4440-a0ca-c4adddb69235">CodeTask</link> </legacyBold></entry>
				<entry>
					Represents the built-in <codeEntityReference qualifyHint="false">T:DemiCode.Scheduling.Tasks.CodeTask</codeEntityReference> task.
				</entry>
			</row>
			<row>
				<entry>
					<legacyBold><link xlink:href="80913175-28b9-46b1-ae4c-455d8fc75d46">ApplicationTask</link> </legacyBold>
				</entry>
				<entry>
					Represents the built-in <codeEntityReference qualifyHint="false">T:DemiCode.Scheduling.Tasks.ApplicationTask</codeEntityReference> task.
				</entry>
			</row>
	</table>
	</content>
</section>
            
       
    

